# Reduz o contexto de build do Docker (ADR-022). O Dockerfile só usa src/,
# frontend/, docker/ e global.json — o resto é lixo que aumenta o upload.

.git
.gitignore
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
tests
docs
backups
temp
artifacts
load-tests
.bug-hunter
*.md
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.infrastructure.yml
docker-compose.production.yml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example